191	 * Set normal styles and emphasis styles about text on target element
192	 * If target is a ZRText. It will create a new style object.
193	 * If target is other Element. It will create or reuse ZRText which is attached on the target.
194	 * And create a new style object.
195	 *
196	 * NOTICE: Because the style on ZRText will be replaced with new(only x, y are keeped).
197	 * So please update the style on ZRText after use this method.
